  "notes": {
    "F-16C_50": "No entry needed: every HOTAS position of the cockpit database is already generic (throttle.lever.cutoff is not on the Warthog profile).",
    "A-10C II": "No entry needed: all positions are generic.",
    "AV8BNA": "ED ships no HOTAS Warthog profile for the module, so stick.hat.sss etc. stay unmapped.",
    "F-15E": "ED ships no HOTAS Warthog profile for the module, so stick.hat.castle / stick.hat.auto_acq etc. stay unmapped.",
    "Mirage-F1EE": "ED ships no HOTAS Warthog profile for the module.",
    "skipped": "Left out on purpose because ED binds them on two Warthog controls: Ka-50 collective.hat.hardpoint (DMS + coolie), collective.rocker.gate_size (TMS + china), collective.switch.shkval_fov (TMS + boat), collective.switch.ap_mode (trim + speed brake); su-27 stick.button.lock (TMS up + slew press), stick.button.weapon_select (MMCB + LTB). throttle.cage (F/A-18 china aft, F-14 LTB) is already a generic position."
  }
